Resume upload not possible: no file input exists in the Greenhouse fixture (see stage_s4.FAILED). The browser-use MCP exposes no dedicated file-upload primitive in its current tool inventory (no equivalent to playwright's browser_file_upload or chrome-devtools' upload_file) — upload would require triggering a native <input type=file> via click + system dialog, which cannot complete without a target input on the page. Fixture-bound failure; the absence of a tool-level upload primitive in browser-use is a separate observation logged in transcript.md.
